cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "zentimes.es work ledger"
message: "If you use this record, please cite it."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: "Aporta Franco"
    given-names: "Fernando"
    alias: ferinazumaDEV
abstract: >-
  A public, dated, reproducible record of the work done on the public pages of
  zentimes.es: what was measured, with which instrument (The GEO Cookbook at tag
  v0.1.4, or the site's public inspector with its criteria version), on which date
  (UTC), and the command that returns the same number. It also captures the rule
  sets the public inspector printed, verbatim and versioned. Every number grades a
  precondition of machine legibility; none measures retrieval, reranking,
  generation or citation by any answer engine.
url: "https://zentimes.es"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ferinazumaDEV/zentimes-ledger"
# ONE license id, as a scalar. A YAML list here breaks the deposit format that
# archive services read (a list converts to {"id": [...]}, and the deposit is
# rejected). Keep this equal to the root LICENSE.
license: CC-BY-SA-4.0
# version and date-released are bumped together; the date is the day of the
# snapshot the ledger was assembled from.
version: "2026.09.23"
date-released: "2026-09-23"
keywords:
  - generative engine optimization
  - GEO
  - machine legibility
  - reproducible measurement
  - public ledger
  - zentimes.es
